{"posts":[{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1076","t":"Hi everyone, Here is a pending order that was triggered yesterday and that I´m still holding. We´ll see what happens. Happy trading","a":"Haydel","d":"","n":"#1076","p":44,"im":["5e9bc5361e58149892630988cb136068d7ffd442"],"m":1076},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1077","t":"Haydel wrote: Hi everyone, Here is a pending order that was triggered yesterday and that I´m still holding. We´ll see what happens. Happy trading\n\nI was just Stooped Out at +46 pips","a":"Haydel","d":"","n":"#1077","p":44,"im":["f5fd011882ea11b2091668b9c1d4b765cb5270d0"],"m":1077},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1078","t":"Ready to BUY GBPUSD!","a":"Haydel","d":"","n":"#1078","p":44,"im":["1b4f8367245c3ef069a2e0f5fd4a6d5a853e12fb"],"m":1078},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1079","t":"Haydel wrote: Ready to BUY GBPUSD!\n\nThat call went wrong. It ended with a loss, that Demand Level did not hold.\n\nI´m using mainly pending orders on my entries to trade Supply/Demand Levels, and currently 65% of my trades are profitable. Pending Orders fit my schedule very well but some times Pending Orders don´t work, like today.\n\nThe reasons why I thought this one was going to work are shown on the attachments, any comments are welcome.\n\nHappy Trading, ______________ Haydel","a":"Haydel","d":"","n":"#1079","p":44,"im":["1b4f8367245c3ef069a2e0f5fd4a6d5a853e12fb","fe61f2579d44be084994020b227e20529ae51e4f","bf5824ab331531b8129418d7b401bb66be3fc427","bc76c2530ec86dbcccbf1c7d5de60db364d40dd0"],"m":1079},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1080","t":"Hi Haydel,\n\nI've noted the way I see it on the chart","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#1080","p":44,"im":["497f824418482da3dcd0d4000d20c8a11e0a555b"],"m":1080},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1081","t":"I see it the same way as Eurotrash.\n\nPrice is now reacting to a lower timeframe very strong engulfing bar, however also this level got tested with another spike (news?) down.\n\nI have two levels for GU (thick lines)\n\n1,4984 is the major S/R H4 flip for a BUY right now 1,5260 the D1 S/R flip which held two times, i wouldnt sell there a third time without decent PA config.","a":"Infest","d":"","n":"#1081","p":44,"im":["9ce2e5a7893f911a201ebbdf663cc84497ad14fe"],"m":1081},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1082","t":"This is my take with UJ. Please feel free to comment criticize:)\n\nAnd then i go into H1....\n\nThanks","a":"johnnym","d":"","n":"#1082","p":44,"im":["01525f80c462821485298a3f872e52d7aba49a3c","af6835a8b3a25f39863ec80673c24c8ea25a57e1"],"m":1082},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1083","t":"Hey Infest, I couldn't help but notice the similarity the AU H4 graphs looked with your GU H4.\n\nBy this time, it seems like GU has already bounced and on its way to next supply:) wonder if AU will follow the same path:D","a":"johnnym","d":"","n":"#1083","p":44,"im":["ea192489981f6496d601210e2b7a15bd0839bf8e"],"m":1083},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1084","t":"For anybody interested in AUDJPY, here's the M5 PA last time it was at this level","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#1084","p":44,"im":["9b166674595762378f267c012492269a78dcdc30"],"m":1084},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1085","t":"and the high of that level was a reaction to this in 2007","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#1085","p":44,"im":["bb7c9d5916cb8f457e050bbb77216d2ecf14fbe8"],"m":1085},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1086","t":"johnnym wrote: Hey Infest, I couldn't help but notice the similarity the AU H4 graphs looked with your GU H4.\n\nHey guys, Just to show you the result of my interpretation. It was not correct, but i guess that's another lesson in my book:P...and it is interesting to watch price action along the zones/lines.","a":"johnnym","d":"","n":"#1086","p":44,"im":["ea192489981f6496d601210e2b7a15bd0839bf8e","7fb13dae5b5120e03ab00fe50f684880a98cb11b"],"m":1086},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1087","t":"johnnym wrote: Hey Infest, I couldn't help but notice the similarity the AU H4 graphs looked with your GU H4.\n\nHey guys, Just to show you the result of my interpretation. It was not correct, but i guess that's another lesson in my book:P...and it is interesting to watch price action along the zones/lines. I guess it was either a fake out or my zone was too narrow. (i'll chalk it up to FO)","a":"johnnym","d":"","n":"#1087","p":44,"im":["ea192489981f6496d601210e2b7a15bd0839bf8e","7fb13dae5b5120e03ab00fe50f684880a98cb11b"],"m":1087},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1088","t":"Not entirely a supply and demand trade but PA displayed enough for a break out north.\n\nAlso, please excuse my absence. I hope everyone has been collecting pips.\n\n2nd chart is larger.","a":"danandsueco","d":"","n":"#1088","p":44,"im":["423fb5ea3323b4e6a26bb33e577ad2856e9c2d41","ebc599619bff516d2d7d05255fdaa3272bf63cc9"],"m":1088},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1089","t":"danandsueco wrote: Not entirely a supply and demand trade but PA displayed enough for a break out north.\n\nAlso, please excuse my absence. I hope everyone has been collecting pips.\n\ngood to see you back Dan. i was watching this GU, it was clear it didnt want to drop but i couldnt have anticipated the move up either. what was the tell sign for you?","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#1089","p":44,"im":[],"m":1089},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1090","t":"Hey guys, my first post here. I just discovered this site and I really like the idea. I've been learning SD concepts for several weeks now, I'm only recently learning to trade them intraday – mostly 5min/1min on EURUSD, EURJPY, USDJPY (small live acc).","a":"Freeze","d":"","n":"#1090","p":44,"im":["322f30001071bc7e4fe2606d67a50dded0dcd01d","3cf8abfe5868ff4480aa38a42d1d1f8ca1e812fd"],"m":1090},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1091","t":"Hey Harry.. please excuse my absence..... In the trade, I saw supply being consumed thus forming a wedge leaning towards a breakout to the north. My entry was late per my style of trading but still within the buying zone. Let me know if that explains things for you.","a":"danandsueco","d":"","n":"#1091","p":44,"im":[],"m":1091},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1092","t":"Simple trade... Pure S&D and PA. I will close shortly (before today closes).\n\n2nd chart is larger.","a":"danandsueco","d":"","n":"#1092","p":44,"im":["2730692ffb4d34a5d9a10f9fd66a9111c7519434","71b5953a2f51614aea327f0921bedd6f63d65cc8"],"m":1092},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1093","t":"Hi Dan..\n\nwelcome back buddy...","a":"faldot","d":"","n":"#1093","p":44,"im":[],"m":1093},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1094","t":"faldot wrote: Hi Dan..\n\nwelcome back buddy...\n\nHey Faldot... Thanks for the welcome. I've been a bit busy.... Hopefully I'll have the time to continue posting. I hope you're doing well.","a":"danandsueco","d":"","n":"#1094","p":44,"im":[],"m":1094},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1095","t":"UJ","a":"whiteout","d":"","n":"#1095","p":44,"im":["89447672e17f11936abd5d8c9b4840ac32666f80"],"m":1095},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1096","t":"Always UJ, simple PA, could keep it longer","a":"whiteout","d":"","n":"#1096","p":44,"im":["b2fae931a8db7f1da54bc646c91ae961bdd15d45"],"m":1096},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1097","t":"That's just yummy!!!!!\n\nNo surprises, no drama. Just bread and butter trading","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#1097","p":44,"im":[],"m":1097},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1098","t":"The USDJPY was a superb one.. engulfed some decent resistance areas and your entry at the FTR was spot on.","a":"Infest","d":"","n":"#1098","p":44,"im":[],"m":1098},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1099","t":"","a":"Eurotrash","d":"","n":"#1099","p":44,"im":["2ca5b2c7ddd5fa6ee610d03db02c07378d7f4a54"],"m":1099},{"id":"supplydemand_p44_1100","t":"Added a few comments on my trade... pretty simple and straight forward.\n\n2nd chart is larger.","a":"danandsueco","d":"","n":"#1100","p":44,"im":["a774414fd7854887e928dff10194b691d32239c7","68753cffaa6ef46834e11f77a7da1598f8b8f896"],"m":1100}],"images":[{"k":"5e9bc5361e58149892630988cb136068d7ffd442","t":"assets/thumbs/5e9bc5361e58149892630988cb136068d7ffd442.webp","f":"assets/images/5e9bc5361e58149892630988cb136068d7ffd442.png","w":1474,"h":630,"b":53844,"o":"5e9bc5361e58149892630988cb13